---
description: >-
  A chain of associations with increasing minimum edge length (`-->`,
  `--->`, `---->`) plus a labelled long edge, checking that extra dashes
  reserve additional layout space between nodes.
---
usecase-beta
    direction LR

    actor User
    A("Base length")
    B("One extra dash")
    C("Two extra dashes")
    D("Labelled long edge")
    User --> A
    A ---> B
    B ----> C
    C -- "longer association" ----> D
